{"amendmentLines":[{"text":"After Clause 44, insert the following new Clause—","indentation":0,"hangingIndentation":null,"isImage":false,"imageType":null},{"text":"<b>“Innovation and competition</b>","indentation":1,"hangingIndentation":null,"isImage":false,"imageType":null},{"text":"In making regulations under sections 42 and 44 the appropriate authority must have regard to—","indentation":1,"hangingIndentation":null,"isImage":false,"imageType":null},{"text":"the encouragement of innovation in the design and operation of pension schemes, and","indentation":2,"hangingIndentation":"(a)","isImage":false,"imageType":null},{"text":"the benefits of competition among providers of pension schemes.”","indentation":2,"hangingIndentation":"(b)","isImage":false,"imageType":null}],"explanatoryTextPrefix":"Member's explanatory statement","explanatoryText":"<p>This amendment would require regulations dealing with non-scale default arrangements to have regard to innovation and competition.</p>","amendmentNote":null,"amendmentLocation":"","mainHeader":"After Clause 44","amendmentId":10033587,"amendmentType":"AddClauseOrSchedule","clause":44,"schedule":null,"pageNumber":null,"lineNumber":null,"amendmentPosition":"After","marshalledListText":"115","dNum":"hol274","id":0,"billId":3982,"billStageId":20513,"statusIndicator":null,"decision":"Agreed","decisionExplanation":"This amendment was agreed to. Where a member has given notice of their intention to oppose a Clause/Schedule standing part of a Bill, 'agreed' indicates that the Clause/Schedule was removed from the Bill.","sponsors":[{"isLead":true,"sortOrder":1,"memberId":2554,"name":"Baroness Noakes","party":"Conservative","partyColour":"0063ba","house":"Lords","memberPhoto":"https://members-api.parliament.uk/api/Members/2554/Thumbnail","memberPage":"https://members.parliament.uk/member/2554/contact","memberFrom":"Life peer"},{"isLead":false,"sortOrder":2,"memberId":4174,"name":"Baroness Stedman-Scott","party":"Conservative","partyColour":"0063ba","house":"Lords","memberPhoto":"https://members-api.parliament.uk/api/Members/4174/Thumbnail","memberPage":"https://members.parliament.uk/member/4174/contact","memberFrom":"Life peer"},{"isLead":false,"sortOrder":3,"memberId":4284,"name":"Baroness Neville-Rolfe","party":"Conservative","partyColour":"0063ba","house":"Lords","memberPhoto":"https://members-api.parliament.uk/api/Members/4284/Thumbnail","memberPage":"https://members.parliament.uk/member/4284/contact","memberFrom":"Life peer"},{"isLead":false,"sortOrder":4,"memberId":4562,"name":"Baroness Bowles of Berkhamsted","party":"Liberal Democrat","partyColour":"fc7d0b","house":"Lords","memberPhoto":"https://members-api.parliament.uk/api/Members/4562/Thumbnail","memberPage":"https://members.parliament.uk/member/4562/contact","memberFrom":"Life peer"}]}